Build the vendored E1 (z3sios) AIR compute library for the S20 Mali-G77.

E1's air_metal.c turns the bitcode Metal hands a function into a Gallium compute
grid through the vendored AIR frontend (src/compiler/redwoodair). The library is
declared here, in panfrost's directory, because libgallium exists here and not
where the frontend is read -- the same reason E1's air-panfrost.patch gives.

The libdrm stand-in is OUR shim, tools/mesa/hakios-drm/hakios.drm.c, copied into
src/hakios-drm by tools/mk-mesa.sh. It speaks the HakiosGPU Panfrost ABI this
port already uses for GL; E1's redwood-drm (RedwoodGPU / RedwoodMali service names
and syncobj selectors 0x7b/0x7c) is deliberately not used. air_metal.c only
needs drmOpenWithType (checked in the source), which our shim provides.

diff --git a/src/compiler/meson.build b/src/compiler/meson.build
index 63c826b..87c568d 100644
--- a/src/compiler/meson.build
+++ b/src/compiler/meson.build
@@ -65,6 +65,8 @@ subdir('spirv')
 
 subdir('air')
 
+subdir('redwoodair')
+
 if with_clc
   subdir('clc')
 endif
diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build b/src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build
index bc66afd..1fc9ff8 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build
@@ -84,3 +84,29 @@ driver_panfrost = declare_dependency(
   compile_args : compile_args_panfrost,
   link_with : [libpanfrost, libpanfrostwinsys, libpanfrost_shared, libpanfrost_midgard, libpanfrost_bifrost, libpanfrost_decode, libpanfrost_lib],
 )
+
+# libredwoodair: the E1 AIR frontend's compute path as a shared library, for
+# the RedwoodMetal plug-in (metal-e1/userland/redwoodmetal.m). Its only contract
+# is metal-e1/air/air_metal.h, which mentions no Mesa headers. Built only when
+# asked; install_name is the path on the device because dlopen uses that path.
+redwoodair_panfrost_drm = []
+if host_machine.system() == 'darwin' and not with_gallium_freedreno
+  redwoodair_panfrost_drm = files('../../../hakios-drm/hakios.drm.c')
+endif
+redwoodair_includes = [inc_include, inc_src, inc_mapi, inc_mesa, inc_gallium,
+                       inc_gallium_aux, inc_gallium_winsys_sw, inc_gallium_winsys,
+                       include_directories('../../drivers')]
+redwoodair_deps = [dep_m, idep_redwoodair, idep_mesautil, idep_xmlconfig,
+                   driver_softpipe, driver_panfrost, dep_libdrm]
+
+libredwoodair = shared_library(
+  'redwoodair',
+  [files('../../../compiler/redwoodair/air_metal.c'), redwoodair_panfrost_drm],
+  include_directories : redwoodair_includes,
+  dependencies : redwoodair_deps,
+  link_with : [libgallium, libgalliumvl_stub, libws_null],
+  link_args : host_machine.system() == 'darwin' ?
+    ['-Wl,-install_name,/redwood/lib/libredwoodair.dylib'] : [],
+  build_by_default : false,
+  install : false,
+)
